! The molt census ~ the exemption list

The census (`tools/source-pointer.mjs --census`) gives every tracked path a kind by rule. An unclassified path reads red; an unbound path reports. This carrier holds the one list of paths that stand outside the census by name: the seed seat, the genesis artifacts, the submodules and the vendored third-party kit. A path off the list reads its plain kind. A line naming a path that left the tree reads red too, so the list never trails the tree.

<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/seed-seat`>>

<<~/ahu>>

